# File-Based Routing for Docs and Blog

This template uses two dynamic route shapes:

- `/docs/[...segments]`
- `/blog/[slug]`

The docs route is a catch-all so nested files become nested URLs.

## Example

```text
app/content/docs/guides/static-deployment.md
```

becomes:

```text
/docs/guides/static-deployment
```

For blog posts, each Markdown file becomes a single slug page under `/blog`.
